Protocol Goedel.Hsp HspProtocol HspProtocol
	

	Section 2 "Thing service"

	Description 
		|Carnet Ledger Protocol maintaining a record of carnet accounts.

    Using Goedel.Cryptography.Jose
    Using Goedel.Cryptography.Dare

	Section 3 "Shared Classes"
    Service ThingService "_thing._tcp" "carnet" ThingRequest ThingResponse
		Description


	Message ThingRequest
		External Goedel.Protocol.Request
		Description
			|Base class for all requests made to a registrar


	Message ThingResponse
		External Goedel.Protocol.Response		
		Description
			|Base class for all response messages. Contains only the
			|status code and status description fields.



	//Hello
    Transaction Public Hello HelloRequest MeshHelloResponse
		Description
			|Report service and version information. 
		Description
			|The Hello transaction provides a means of determining which protocol
			|versions, message encodings and transport protocols are supported by
			|the service.
		Description
			|The PostConstraints field MAY be used to advise senders of a maximum
			|size of payload that MAY be sent in an initial Post request.


	Message MeshHelloRequest
		External Goedel.Protocol.HelloRequest		

	Message MeshHelloResponse
		External Goedel.Protocol.HelloResponse	
		GStruct Enveloped ProfileService ProfileService
			Description
				|The enveloped master profile of the service.



